      "lines": [
        "Architecture: Upsampling",
        "(Transposed Convolutional Layer)",
        "• Also called “fractional convolutional layer”, “backward convolution”, and, incorrectly,",
        "”deconvolution layer”",
        "• Idea: learn filters with a fractional sized stride to upsample the coarse image while refining",
        "it based on the filter values; e.g.,",
        "https://www.machinecurve.com/index.php/2019/09/29/understanding￾transposed-convolutions/#the-goal-reconstructing-the-original-input"
      ]
    },
    {
