        "• Idea: learn filters with a fractional sized stride to upsample the coarse image while refining",
        "it based on the filter values; e.g.,",
        "https://d2l.ai/chapter_computer-vision/transposed-conv.html",
        "(padding is used to",
        "intermediate values)"
      ]
    },
